Package: nvidia-legacy-470xx-driver-libs
Architecture: amd64 i386
Multi-Arch: same
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}
Provides: nvidia-legacy-470xx-driver-libs-nonglvnd
Description: NVIDIA legacy 470.256.02 driver — core runtime libraries
 Shared libraries used by the NVIDIA 470.256.02 driver: libnvidia-glcore,
 libnvidia-tls, libnvidia-eglcore and friends. Install the :i386 variant
 alongside for 32-bit OpenGL applications.

