Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: NVIDIA legacy 470.256.02 driver — utilities
 nvidia-smi, nvidia-settings' backend, nvidia-xconfig, nvidia-debugdump and
 the nvidia-persistenced daemon for the 470.256.02 driver.

