Package: nvidia-legacy-470xx-kernel-support
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Provides: nvidia-legacy-470xx-kernel-support-nonglvnd
Description: NVIDIA legacy 470.256.02 driver — kernel/X integration glue
 Ships the nouveau blacklist, the modprobe alias, the initramfs hook, the udev
 rules and the /etc/X11/xorg.conf.d snippet for the 470.256.02 driver.

Package: nvidia-legacy-470xx-kernel-6.14.0-1-generic
